Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)我要发动装备在希望皇霍普上的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法·希望皇霍普的更进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)获得使用 No.龙与
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊吸食者的超量单位的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？将所有的怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都集中到1只霍普身上了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个霍普的超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 No.龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，助我一臂之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)1回合1次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击力提升场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有超量怪兽的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级合计乘以1000点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.07,0:00:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和我场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽的阶级合计是23。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 霍普的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升至25500！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升攻击力了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 与我的努梅罗尼亚斯 努梅罗尼亚的10万
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还远远不及。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:00:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！还没
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的叠放单位还有剩余。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.21,0:01:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用霍普的叠放单位…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)深渊激流的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.86,0:01:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到战斗结束攻击力变为2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将霍普的2个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部使用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力变为4倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 攻击力就是10万2000了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力超过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普 攻击努梅罗尼亚斯 努梅罗尼亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 努梅罗尼亚斯 努梅罗尼亚的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用混沌叠放单元，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.53,0:01:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手怪兽的攻击无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，我还会获得攻击过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽攻击力数值的生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:02:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值有10万，怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你们做什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都敌不过神的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定。什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的希望之光还没有消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们羁绊的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信同伴的力量之强。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.69,0:02:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们最后的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 双倍机会发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.03,0:02:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 当1只怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被无效时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使那只怪兽的攻击力变成2倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且可以再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！ 攻击力20万4000!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(众人)上啊 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.53,0:02:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}努梅罗尼亚斯 攻击努梅罗尼亚。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(泽尔)与霍普一同战斗过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的羁绊 希望皇的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就让你见识一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必杀的最终希望剑·斩!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇啊～!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 成功了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他们赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了 千尊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了啊 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通往星光界的次元之门正在关闭！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，后面。哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 地上与异晶界的融合
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经停止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 我竟然会败北。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的野心已经彻底崩塌了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算我毁灭了真正的诅咒依然没有解开。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们很快就会知道这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌才是生命之源混沌是无限的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修 你明白吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么？会发生什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨…鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些 No.卡我可不能交给你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral，你说的另一边的世界难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral世界！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么Astral世界会？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边明明是我们的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且和异晶界又融合在一起了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界不是已经被拯救了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（纳修）不。地上已经完全
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和异晶界融合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是连接那个世界与星灵世界的场所。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在，两个世界正在互相吸引。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样放任不管的话不久两个世界就会相撞{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星灵世界将会毁灭吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明都打倒唐·萨赞德了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且你！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克，难道你是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，因为我继承了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·萨赞德的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·萨赞德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该是我们的敌人才对啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？我是巴利安的战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们的敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有宇宙的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是为了追求升级而被创造出来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但在那过程中，劣质品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被逐渐抛弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是混沌，而那股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让巴利安世界不断壮大。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以说，我们的世界就是一群废柴的集合。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是啊，我没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对巴利安世界弃之不顾。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个世界里，也有我的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无可替代的同伴。鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样，我们也不能！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界的使命，那就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:08:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用 No.代码{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消灭巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，两个世界一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存活下去的路，一定存在的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果两个世界合为一体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量变弱的星光界就会消失吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们只剩下其中一方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存活下去这条路了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们就是为了这样的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直在战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们的宿命。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不承认这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直相信，我、你还有大家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天一定能互相理解！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！你只是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没解开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上的诅咒而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，这或许是他的诅咒。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，这个诅咒绝对解不开！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上干涉了七皇的人生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}篡改了那段记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:10:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，对我却什么都没做。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为他操纵了与我有关的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.59,0:10:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我凭自己的意志走上巴利安的道路，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诱导我这么做。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭自己的意志？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是我凭自己的意志选择的道路{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就绝对会沿着那条路走到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕与你们的友情挡在面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也绝不会抛弃巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙所说的真正的诅咒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是我的存在本身啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的朋友，鲨鱼，也就是神代凌牙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我决定作为巴利安活下去的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就已经死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，现在正是做个了断的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨、鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去找出来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗之中你所追寻的答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们一直以来都是这么走过来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.25,0:11:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了！ 我来干！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！ 决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡发动！ 升格之天地降札！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌的怪兽卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组把 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我加入手牌的是 这张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 升阶魔法 七皇之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ No.101！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉方舟骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将 方舟骑士 混沌化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:12:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌异变！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.101！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要召唤 双头鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只水属性怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双头鲨 会变成那只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双头鲨 变成 暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后被这个效果选中的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每回合都能直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.90,0:12:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌交错护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有相同混沌怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些怪兽不会成为攻击对象{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不会因效果被破坏或除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊 游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去 每回合都要承受
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2800的直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.35,0:13:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放两张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们真的能在这场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到答案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的能找到拯救大家的未来吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.59,0:13:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 有一个能解决所有问题的办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 No.代码。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗的胜者 将成为能改写过去与未来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切事物的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码的持有者。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说你要用它 把全部历史都改写掉吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 把至今发生的一切全都归无。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确 只要使用 No.代码的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场战斗中牺牲的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许就能得救。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 星光 那真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们真正的未来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论多么艰难痛苦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都不逃避拼命战斗至今{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一瞬 一瞬的积累之中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的未来不就在那里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 那种东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我们战斗争取来的未来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 说得没错 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西没有任何价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是以前的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会毫不犹豫地使用 No.卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 现在的我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 不明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此 才要进行决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗就是我的热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是和鲨鱼的决斗 一定能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到些什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界… 既然你那么热血沸腾地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说要去找到答案{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我也干给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我的热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 隆隆七 特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有怪兽超量存在的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从1到8随意变更等级！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.45,0:15:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 我我我魔术师变成等级7！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级7的隆隆七和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.11！ 大眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动大眼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得对手1只怪兽的控制权！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要夺走暗黑骑士的控制权！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 使用这个效果的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:15:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大眼不能进行战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动暗黑骑士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把对手场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成自己的混沌超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士！ 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们会这样来我早就知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是为了集齐七皇的 No.的痛楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！七皇之双璧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在受到 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组将这两只特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 CNo.102 高贵恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.103 寂灭 infinity！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 怪兽效果全部无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 超百 No.专用卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 连这一步都提前读到了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《上吧 多鲁贝！ 梅拉格！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 寂灭 infinity 攻击 big eye！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再用 高贵恶魔 攻击 暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 暗黑骑士的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有 混沌超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当这张卡被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到自己的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复暗黑骑士攻击力的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的生命值恢复了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士！ 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤嘎嘎嘎守卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在受到直接攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.59,0:18:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 还挺有一套的嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我们的答案还没出来呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤嘎嘎嘎凯撒！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有嘎嘎嘎怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤嘎嘎嘎乌鸦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.91,0:18:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我发动 嘎嘎嘎凯撒的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次 从自己的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔法师除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成与除外的怪兽相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎凯撒和乌鸦的等级变为4。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的嘎嘎嘎凯撒和乌鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动装备魔法终极·霍普剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给霍普装备这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升800点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普！ 攻击黑暗骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极·霍普剑·斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.43,0:20:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间究极·霍普剑的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中破坏怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将装备怪兽以外的所有怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.91,0:20:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都在预料之中。什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 混沌超量·混沌·宇宙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在这个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上被破坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量·No.们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效化全部特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照复活的怪兽相同数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌超量·No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方场上以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.03,0:20:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我们的场上？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:21:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.104！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}假面魔导士 暗影！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.105！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手 彗星之拳套！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.106！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}熔岩掌 巨手·红！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要把怪兽召唤到我们的场上！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠光红莲之召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有叠光红莲 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将1只叠光红莲 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无视召唤条件{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 所有的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超百 CNo.都到场上来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.91,0:22:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。不 纳修 你是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下吧见识身为异晶人的我的真正力量。

